@startuml
title Ask-SLM Core Runtime Class Diagram (Expanded)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class RunnerContext {
  +view_name: str
  +workspace_dir: Path
  +workspace_input_dir: Path
  +config_dir: Path
  +results_dir: Path
  +logs_dir: Path
  +cache_dir: Path
  +run_log_path: Path
}

class RunLogger {
  +run_log_path: Path
  +echo_default: bool
  +log(message: str, echo: bool = None): None
}

class SRAWorkspaceInputAccessor {
  +prepare_workspace_inputs(context, logger): (DataFrame, DataFrame, Path, Path)
  +_collect_input_files(view_dir, kind, logger): List[Path]
  +_aggregate_metadata(parts, logger): DataFrame
  +_aggregate_taxonomy(parts, logger): DataFrame
}

class MappingEngine {
  +config_dir: Path
  +refresh_template(metadata_df, project_id, view_name): None
  +map(metadata_df, project_id, view_name): DataFrame
}

class TaxonomyAccessor {
  +build_from_dataframe(df): None
  +save_database(path): None
  +load_database(path): None
  +get_ancestor_at_rank(tax_id, rank): Dict
  +aggregate_counts_at_rank(...): DataFrame
}

class EnvoResolutionEngine {
  +resolve_envo_columns(metadata_df, envo_cache, candidate_columns, fetch_term): EnvoResolutionResult
}

class EnvoOntologyAccessor {
  +fetch_term(envo_id): Dict
}

class MappingConfigManager {
  +config_dir: Path
  +_load_projects(): bool
  +_build_project_metadata_value_summaries(): None
  +run(): None
}

class AlphaDiversityEngine {
  +analysis_wide_df: DataFrame
  +taxon_lookup_df: DataFrame
  +metadata_cols: list
  +run(): None
}

class TaxonomicAbundanceEngine {
  +abundance_metadata_matrix: DataFrame
  +taxon_lookup_df: DataFrame
  +metadata_cols: list
  +_calculate_abundance(rank, taxon): DataFrame
  +run(): None
}

class RunnerPipeline {
  +initialize_runner_context(workspace): (RunnerContext, RunLogger)
  +prepare_workspace_inputs(context, logger)
  +refresh_mapping_templates(metadata_df, context, logger)
  +run_enrichment_stage(...): (DataFrame, List[str], List[str], Dict[str, Any])
  +enrich_envo_columns(...): (DataFrame, DataFrame)
  +run_taxonomy_stage(...): (DataFrame, DataFrame, Dict[str, Any])
  +run_merge_stage(...): (DataFrame, List[str], Dict[str, Any])
  +build_or_load_tax_accessor(...): TaxonomyAccessor
}

class CliRuntime {
  +_resolve_runtime_paths(args): None
  +_resolve_view_input_dir(view, inputs_dir): Path
  +_resolve_lineage_paths(args): (Path, Path)
}

class CliCommands {
  +cmd_build_taxonomy_lineage(args): None
  +cmd_alpha_diversity(args): None
  +cmd_taxonomic_abundance(args): None
  +cmd_single_taxon_abundance(args): None
  +cmd_abundance_matrix(args): None
  +cmd_metadata_overview(args): None
}

class LineageStamp {
  +schema_version: str
  +view_name: str
  +taxonomy_sha256: str
  +taxonomy_rows: int
}

class StageStamp {
  +schema_version: str
  +view_name: str
  +dependencies: Dict[str, Any]
}

RunnerPipeline ..> RunnerContext : creates
RunnerPipeline ..> RunLogger : creates
RunnerPipeline ..> SRAWorkspaceInputAccessor : uses
RunnerPipeline ..> MappingEngine : uses
RunnerPipeline ..> EnvoResolutionEngine : uses
RunnerPipeline ..> EnvoOntologyAccessor : uses
RunnerPipeline ..> TaxonomyAccessor : uses
RunnerPipeline ..> StageStamp : reads/writes

MappingConfigManager ..> RunLogger : injected logger
AlphaDiversityEngine ..> TaxonomyAccessor : injected shared accessor
AlphaDiversityEngine ..> RunLogger : injected logger
TaxonomicAbundanceEngine ..> RunLogger : injected logger

CliCommands ..> CliRuntime : uses path resolution
CliCommands ..> MappingEngine : uses for enrichment
CliCommands ..> TaxonomyAccessor : uses lineage DB build/load
CliCommands ..> LineageStamp : reads/writes

note right of RunnerPipeline
Stages are cache-aware:
- enrichment stamp
- taxonomy stamp
- merge stamp
- lineage DB stamp (runner cache)
end note

note right of CliCommands
Alpha-diversity has a hard precondition:
taxonomy lineage DB must exist.
If missing, CLI exits with actionable remediation.
end note

@enduml